{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gloctopus",
    "steam_appid": 3590670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/c9904a0562a0435d3c544c51a3dd2b37.avif?t=1755136904\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hyper-intelligent octopus agent on a critical underwater mission. Armed with an arsenal of devastating weapons, you must navigate the treacherous depths of the ocean to defeat dangerous enemies and formidable bosses that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your approach by swapping out your load-out with new weapons discovered throughout your journey. Each weapon offers unique capabilities that can be tailored to suit your mission objectives and preferred play-style, allowing you to adapt to the challenges that await in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve and adapt as you progress by mutating with powerful new abilities and passive enhancements. These mutations ensure that every dive into the abyss offers a fresh and unique experience, keeping you engaged as you discover new combinations and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the endless depths of the mysterious sea for as long as your skills allow. Venture deeper and deeper to encounter a diverse array of fascinating and dangerous creatures, each presenting their own challenges and rewards as you push the limits of how far you can survive in this hostile underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloctopus combines roguelike elements with intense action gameplay, where each run presents new opportunities for discovery and mastery. How deep can you go?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/c9904a0562a0435d3c544c51a3dd2b37.avif?t=1755136904\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hyper-intelligent octopus agent on a critical underwater mission. Armed with an arsenal of devastating weapons, you must navigate the treacherous depths of the ocean to defeat dangerous enemies and formidable bosses that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/f370f72715b066cdc2fcf2ad1010f5b8.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your approach by swapping out your load-out with new weapons discovered throughout your journey. Each weapon offers unique capabilities that can be tailored to suit your mission objectives and preferred play-style, allowing you to adapt to the challenges that await in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/e2fe9d28f59d6dcc079267dfdb69f711.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve and adapt as you progress by mutating with powerful new abilities and passive enhancements. These mutations ensure that every dive into the abyss offers a fresh and unique experience, keeping you engaged as you discover new combinations and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the endless depths of the mysterious sea for as long as your skills allow. Venture deeper and deeper to encounter a diverse array of fascinating and dangerous creatures, each presenting their own challenges and rewards as you push the limits of how far you can survive in this hostile underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.poster.avif?t=1755136904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.webm?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590670/extras/d55b2c202455583b538fc2b665863cc4.mp4?t=1755136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloctopus combines roguelike elements with intense action gameplay, where each run presents new opportunities for discovery and mastery. How deep can you go?</p>",
    "short_description": "Gloctopus is a fast-paced rogue-like game where you control a gun-wielding octopus, using all eight arms to blast enemies while navigating chaotic arenas. Master movement, manage your ink-powered abilities, and adapt your loadout to survive levels of relentless foes.",
